8,Jonkor language,https://grokipedia.com/page/jonkor_language,"Jonkor Bourmataguil (also known simply as Jonkor, or by alternate names Djongor Bourmataguil, Dougne, and Karakir) is an endangered East Chadic language belonging to the Afro-Asiatic family, spoken by the Jegu people in southeastern Chad.",Jonkor Bourmataguil,Afro-Asiatic
